## Legacy 1.3.x localization artifacts
# 1.11.0 dropped the loc/ JSON layer — settings are now stored in
# %LOCALAPPDATA%/NotifyIsland/settings.json only. Ignore stray loc/ folders
# left from 1.3.x checkouts or accidental drag-into-publish copies so they
# never sneak into a build.
loc/
loc/*.json

## Stale release debug bits
# Setup directories sometimes end up with .NET preview debugger files
# (coreclr.dll, mscordaccore*.dll, *_cor3.dll). Never source-controlled.
coreclr.dll
mscordaccore*.dll
mscordbi.dll
PenImc_cor3.dll
PresentationNative_cor3.dll
wpfgfx_cor3.dll
vcruntime140_cor3.dll
D3DCompiler_47_cor3.dll

